Package: rpi-pishutdown
Version: 1.3.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: rpi-fake-sleep
Description: Standby-enabled Shutdown Dialog for Raspberry Pi OS (Labwc / LXDE)
 Drop-in replacement for /usr/bin/pishutdown on Raspberry Pi OS.
 Adds a "Standby (Ruhezustand)" button that interfaces with systemd-suspend
 and rpi-fake-sleep for low-power sleep mode.
 Diverts the original /usr/bin/pishutdown safely using dpkg-divert.
